This product bundles `broker/player.ejs`, which is the session-player template
from Steel (steel-dev/steel-browser), used verbatim and unmodified.

  Steel — https://github.com/steel-dev/steel-browser
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The broker renders this template with its own parameters (a window-scoped
WebSocket URL) to provide a per-window live viewer. No bytes of the template
are changed. To update it after a Steel upgrade, copy the current
`/app/api/src/templates/live-session-streamer.ejs` from the Steel image over
`broker/player.ejs`.
